; =====================================================================
; probe_bc_keywords.jou -- STEP 0. Run this ONCE, before any real case.
; =====================================================================
; case_template.jou was authored without a live Fluent session. Three things
; in it are version-sensitive and cheap to verify but expensive to get wrong:
;
;   1. the grouped `set` menu KEYWORD NAMES for velocity-inlet /
;      pressure-outlet / wall (are the 2D velocity components `u`/`v`, or
;      `x-velocity`/`y-velocity`? is the SA inlet field `turb-viscosity-ratio`
;      or `nut`?);
;   2. the number of RESIDUAL EQUATIONS, which differs between SA (continuity,
;      x-vel, y-vel, nut = 4) and k-omega SST (+ k, omega = 6), and which
;      /solve/monitors/residual/convergence-criteria takes positionally;
;   3. the valid integer codes for /solve/set/discretization-scheme.
;
; A wrong keyword in a grouped `set` menu does not fail loudly -- the
; unanswered prompt EATS THE FOLLOWING JOURNAL LINES, and the case solves with
; silently wrong boundary conditions. That failure mode has corrupted real
; multi-case batches before. Ten seconds of probing removes it.
;
; Usage:
;   substitute {{MESH_PATH}} and {{OUT_DIR}}, then
;   mcp__ansys__fluent_run_journal, or
;   fluent 2ddp -g -i probe_bc_keywords.jou -wait
;
; Then read the transcript and reconcile every keyword against
; case_template.jou BEFORE running make_cases.py output.
; =====================================================================

/file/start-transcript "{{OUT_DIR}}/probe_keywords.trn"
/file/read-case "{{MESH_PATH}}"

; --- zone names actually present in the mesh -------------------------
/define/boundary-conditions/list-zones

; --- Spalart-Allmaras: keywords + residual equation list -------------
/define/models/viscous/spalart-allmaras yes
/define/boundary-conditions/set/velocity-inlet farfield ()
info
q
/define/boundary-conditions/set/pressure-outlet outlet ()
info
q
/define/boundary-conditions/set/wall airfoil ()
info
q
/solve/monitors/residual/print-list
/solve/set/discretization-scheme/mom
/solve/set/discretization-scheme/pressure

; --- k-omega SST: same probe (the keyword set changes with the model) -
/define/models/viscous/kw-sst yes
/define/boundary-conditions/set/velocity-inlet farfield ()
info
q
/define/boundary-conditions/set/pressure-outlet outlet ()
info
q
/solve/monitors/residual/print-list

; --- report-definition argument names --------------------------------
/solve/report-definitions/add cd_probe drag
/solve/report-definitions/list-properties cd_probe

/file/stop-transcript
exit
ok
